1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,881
Big Mouth Baby by Katie Clark
凯蒂·克拉克的大嘴宝贝

2
00:00:01,881 --> 00:00:04,136
Max gets ready for his birthday party
Max为他的生日派对做准备

3
00:00:04,282 --> 00:00:05,977
He puts candles on his cake
他把蜡烛放在蛋糕上

4
00:00:06,322 --> 00:00:07,937
The baby grabs the candles
婴儿抓起蜡烛

5
00:00:07,961 --> 00:00:10,240
Max hangs Pin the Tail on the Donkey
麦克斯把尾巴钉在驴子身上

6
00:00:10,242 --> 00:00:11,776
The baby rips the tail
婴儿撕开尾巴

7
00:00:12,041 --> 00:00:13,856
Max blows up balloons
Max吹气球

8
00:00:14,041 --> 00:00:16,216
The baby pops the balloons
婴儿弹出气球

9
00:00:16,402 --> 00:00:19,856
Max says, "Stop!" The baby cries
麦克斯说，“住手！”婴儿哭了

10
00:00:20,001 --> 00:00:21,696
What a big mouth baby
真是个大嘴巴宝贝

11
00:00:21,722 --> 00:00:22,617
Party time!
派对时间！

12
00:00:22,801 --> 00:00:25,856
Max wishes for a horse when he blows out his candles
Max吹蜡烛的时候想要一匹马

13
00:00:26,922 --> 00:00:27,960
The baby smiles
宝宝笑了

14
00:00:27,961 --> 00:00:29,856
Max opens his presents
Max打开他的礼物

15
00:00:30,321 --> 00:00:31,396
The baby claps
婴儿拍手

16
00:00:31,396 --> 00:00:33,817
Max and his friends play party games
Max和他的朋友玩派对游戏

17
00:00:33,921 --> 00:00:35,161
The baby giggles
宝宝咯咯笑

18
00:00:35,161 --> 00:00:36,616
The guests go home
客人们都回家了

19
00:00:37,362 --> 00:00:38,539
Max smiles
Max笑了

20
00:00:38,539 --> 00:00:39,761
He hugs the baby
他拥抱着孩子

21
00:00:39,762 --> 00:00:42,057
The baby yells because he is happy
婴儿因为高兴而大叫

22
00:00:42,362 --> 00:00:43,896
The baby is so loud
宝宝声音好大

23
00:00:44,161 --> 00:00:45,976
Max covers his ears
Max捂住耳朵

24
00:00:46,201 --> 00:00:48,322
What a big mouth baby!
真是个大嘴巴宝贝！

